<title>BELGIUM: Spanish air force jet crashes in Belgium.</title>
<headline>Spanish air force jet crashes in Belgium.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Spanish air force Mirage F-1 aircraft has crashed in Malmedy, south-east Belgium, but the pilot ejected safely and nobody was hurt, the Belgian air force said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said the plane had taken off from the German airbase of Norvenich, close to Duren, where it took part in a NATO exercise.</p>
</text>
